porchcam (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial package: publishes USB/IP cameras over RTSP via mediamtx with
    optional VAAPI re-encode; desktop overlays with a live Adjust panel
    (brightness/contrast/colour/hue + noise filter); v4l2loopback virtual
    camera for video calls; porchcam-config declarative configuration; and
    optional self-healing units (corruption monitor, nightly encoder reset).

